menuconfig ZMK_VIA
    bool "VIA compatibility for ZMK"
    depends on RAW_HID
    depends on ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL
    depends on ZMK_KEYMAP_SETTINGS_STORAGE
    default y
    help
      Expose the current ZMK runtime keymap through the QMK/VIA Raw HID
      protocol. Changes are saved through the normal ZMK keymap settings API.
